{"id":"1f29f6b99cd5f0ce","group":"58","path":"58/batch12/58-df-zfc-measure3-measure-completion.md","title":"ZFC Measure3 Measure Completion","display":"df-zfc-measure3-measure-completion — ZFC Measure3 Measure Completion","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-measure3-measure-completion","aliases":["58-df-zfc-measure3-measure-completion"],"display":"df-zfc-measure3-measure-completion — ZFC Measure3 Measure Completion","depends_on":["[[58-df-measure-space]]","[[58-df-measure]]","[[58-df-zfc-measure8-complete-measure-space]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-measure3-measure-completion"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-measure3-measure-completion</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-measure3-measure-completion — ZFC Measure3 Measure Completion"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"83a15c7e9b3817dc\" href=\"?note=83a15c7e9b3817dc\" title=\"58-df-measure-space\">58-df-measure-space</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ca832ed6bc22f728\" href=\"?note=ca832ed6bc22f728\" title=\"58-df-measure\">58-df-measure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"689b97c5dc1316d6\" href=\"?note=689b97c5dc1316d6\" title=\"58-df-zfc-measure8-complete-measure-space\">58-df-zfc-measure8-complete-measure-space</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> (underlying set)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma\">\\(\\Sigma\\)</span> (sigma algebra, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"83a15c7e9b3817dc\" href=\"?note=83a15c7e9b3817dc\" title=\"58-df-measure-space\">58-df-measure-space</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu\">\\(\\mu\\)</span> (measure, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"ca832ed6bc22f728\" href=\"?note=ca832ed6bc22f728\" title=\"58-df-measure\">58-df-measure</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\widehat{\\Sigma}\">\\(\\widehat{\\Sigma}\\)</span> (completed sigma algebra)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\mu\">\\(\\widehat\\mu\\)</span> (completed measure)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Measure}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Measure}_S\\)</span> (measure predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"ca832ed6bc22f728\" href=\"?note=ca832ed6bc22f728\" title=\"58-df-measure\">58-df-measure</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure8CompleteMeasureSpace}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure8CompleteMeasureSpace}_S\\)</span> (complete-measure-space predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure3MeasureCompletion}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure3MeasureCompletion}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure3\\text{-}measure\\text{-}completion}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure3MeasureCompletion}_S(X,\\Sigma,\\mu,\\widehat\\Sigma,\\widehat\\mu)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\mu,X,\\Sigma)\n\\land\\widehat\\Sigma=\\{A\\cup N:A\\in\\Sigma\\land\\exists Z\\in\\Sigma\\;(N\\subseteq Z\\land\\mu(Z)=0)\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall B\\in\\widehat\\Sigma\\;\\left(\\widehat\\mu(B)=\\inf\\{\\mu(A):A\\in\\Sigma\\land B\\subseteq A\\}\\right)\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure8CompleteMeasureSpace}_S(X,\\widehat\\Sigma,\\widehat\\mu).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure3\\text{-}measure\\text{-}completion}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure3MeasureCompletion}_S(X,\\Sigma,\\mu,\\widehat\\Sigma,\\widehat\\mu)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\mu,X,\\Sigma)\n\\land\\widehat\\Sigma=\\{A\\cup N:A\\in\\Sigma\\land\\exists Z\\in\\Sigma\\;(N\\subseteq Z\\land\\mu(Z)=0)\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall B\\in\\widehat\\Sigma\\;\\left(\\widehat\\mu(B)=\\inf\\{\\mu(A):A\\in\\Sigma\\land B\\subseteq A\\}\\right)\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure8CompleteMeasureSpace}_S(X,\\widehat\\Sigma,\\widehat\\mu).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The completion contains every subset of every <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu\">\\(\\mu\\)</span>-null measurable set and equips the enlarged <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\">\\(\\sigma\\)</span>-algebra with the canonical extension <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\mu\">\\(\\widehat\\mu\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-measure-space","status":"resolved","id":"83a15c7e9b3817dc","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-measure-space]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-measure","status":"resolved","id":"ca832ed6bc22f728","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-measure]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-measure8-complete-measure-space","status":"resolved","id":"689b97c5dc1316d6","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-measure8-complete-measure-space]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-measure-space","status":"resolved","id":"83a15c7e9b3817dc","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Sigma$ (sigma algebra, see [[58-df-measure-space]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-measure","status":"resolved","id":"ca832ed6bc22f728","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mu$ (measure, see [[58-df-measure]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-measure","status":"resolved","id":"ca832ed6bc22f728","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Measure}_S$ (measure predicate, see [[58-df-measure]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\mu","display":false},{"tex":"\\widehat{\\Sigma}","display":false},{"tex":"\\widehat\\mu","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Measure}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure8CompleteMeasureSpace}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure3MeasureCompletion}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure3\\text{-}measure\\text{-}completion}\\vdash{}&\n\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure3MeasureCompletion}_S(X,\\Sigma,\\mu,\\widehat\\Sigma,\\widehat\\mu)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\mu,X,\\Sigma)\n\\land\\widehat\\Sigma=\\{A\\cup N:A\\in\\Sigma\\land\\exists Z\\in\\Sigma\\;(N\\subseteq Z\\land\\mu(Z)=0)\\}\\\\\n&\\land\\forall B\\in\\widehat\\Sigma\\;\\left(\\widehat\\mu(B)=\\inf\\{\\mu(A):A\\in\\Sigma\\land B\\subseteq A\\}\\right)\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure8CompleteMeasureSpace}_S(X,\\widehat\\Sigma,\\widehat\\mu).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mu","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\widehat\\mu","display":false}],"bytes":1589,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2584","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-zfc-measure3-measure-completion.md|58-df-zfc-measure3-measure-completion]]（batch12）"}],"outgoing":["83a15c7e9b3817dc","ca832ed6bc22f728","689b97c5dc1316d6"]}